# Music AI Multi-Tool Hub - Local Environment Variables
# Now that the project is on Cloudflare Pages/Workers, most secrets live in the Cloudflare dashboard.

# No variables are strictly required for local frontend development (npm run dev) 
# as the app calls the production Gemini Worker proxy directly.

# Local Suno proxy testing (requires a running local Worker):
#   cd gemini-worker && npx wrangler dev --port 8787
# then uncomment the line below and restart `npm run dev`.
# VITE_SUNO_WORKER_URL=http://localhost:8787